	"description": "P34 (plan M6-M9 section 5.13): the Troll Matriarch of the Troll Den - 9 m, 3,200 health, poise 220 (x3.5 in recovery), armour 25, regenerating 12 hp/s (13 in phase 2) unless Burning (P39, M9 balance: 25 / 40 -> 15 / 25 in iteration 1 -> 12 / 15 in iteration 3; M9 gate: 12 / 13). Phase 1: the club sweep (140 degree cone), the stomp (7 m circle, unblockable) and the whelp throw (a whelp hurled as a thrown body along an aim line). Phase 2 (at 50 %): a 1.5 s roar that calls a whelp (P39: three -> two; M9 gate: two -> one), the two-sweep frenzy (M9 gate: 55 + 65 -> 35 + 40, its punish window 1.3 -> 3.0 s: the conqueror novice died in her phase 2 in every attempt of the M9 confirmation and slew her in none). A brazier broken within 8 m of her sets her Burning for 8 s; a burning whelp or troll thrown at her sets her Burning for 10 s and deals 300 fire damage. Never grabbable (Grab immunity; 9 m is more than half of a stage-5 giant). The drive-out ending: once the den's nests are burned and its back wall is open (the flags below), at 60 % she flees through the wall (boss.matriarch.outcome fled, boss_disengaged fled).",
